---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Membership Benefits
description: IEEE Student and Graduate Student membership benefits — access to the world's largest engineering community, resources, and opportunities.
permalink: /membership-benefits/
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Membership & Benefits</span>
      <h1>Become an <span style="color: var(--ieee-blue)">IEEE</span> Member</h1>
      <p>As a Student/Graduate Student Member of IEEE you get access to a global community of 420,000+ professionals.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% set benefits = [
        "Join a community of over 420,000 technology and engineering professionals united by a common desire to continuously learn, interact, collaborate, and innovate.",
        "Collaborate with IEEE colleagues and member groups, online or in person, to build a support group for your profession, industry, or project.",
        "Obtain access to the largest library of electrical engineering, computer science, and electronics technical literature as well as the latest technology trends, industry news, and events.",
        "Get the resources and opportunities you need to keep on top of changes in technology.",
        "Get involved in standards development.",
        "Network with other professionals in your local area or within a specific technical interest.",
        "Are mentored by professional engineers and technologists."
      ] %}
      {% for b in benefits %}
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5); gap: var(--s-3)">
          <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ieee-blue) 12%, transparent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ieee-blue)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-sm)">{{ b }}</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--s-6); color: var(--ink-mute); font-size: var(--fs-sm); max-width: 700px; margin-inline: auto">
      <em>Note: A Student/Graduate Student member must carry at least 50% of a normal full-time academic program. The total cumulative period for a member to hold the Student member grade and/or the Graduate Student member grade is limited to eight years.</em>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

